{"id":"659693","name":"红糖冰粉","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/659693/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冰粉粉","amount":"40g"}],"sub":[{"name":"花生","amount":"适量"},{"name":"瓜子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葡萄干","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小圆子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"山楂片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜜红豆","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"锅里按冰粉比例要求加水烧开。我这是一包粉40克，用水2.5公斤。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193776695154181365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"将冰粉粉倒入容器中。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193776718494791365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"水一定要煮滚。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193776742621351365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"将开水缓缓倒入冰粉中，边倒边搅拌。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193776804725971365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"等热气消散放入冰箱冷藏。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193776868439381365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"红糖倒入水中煮开，红糖水晾凉。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193805468426951365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"提前煮点红豆，拌上白砂糖，放冰箱冷藏一晚上，就做成蜜豆。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193817567356481365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"提前用糯米粉做的小圆子，放冰箱冷冻保存，水烧开直接下冷冻小圆子煮熟，捞出来过凉水更筋道。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193817078718021365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"准备小料。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193993480233971365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"冰粉已经凝结成块了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193995247704451365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"所有材料准备妥当。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193994365959921365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"先盛一碗duangduang的冰粉。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193996925736981365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"满满铺一层小料。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617193997224451961365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入红糖水。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617194002441172981365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":15,"desc":"冰冰凉凉细滑香甜的冰粉。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/26/2024062617194002536421251365842.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}